{"learnerLanguage":"en","spokenSeconds":150,"turns":[{"speaker":"character","text":"Good afternoon. My name is James. Could you tell me your full name?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Good afternoon. My name is Lukas Becker."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Let's talk about your work. What do you do?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"I am working as an engineer for a car company in Stuttgart. I am working here since three years and I like it, because the team is nice."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Is there anything you would like to change about your job?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Maybe the hours. Sometimes I must stay very long in the office and then I have no time for sport."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Describe a change in your life that made you happier. Say what the change was, when it happened, how it affected you, and explain why it made you happier."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"OK. Last year my company said that we have the possibility to make home office two days in the week. Before I drove one hour every day to the office. Now I can sleep longer and I must not wear a tie at home. It makes me more relaxed than before, and I have more time for my family and for running in the forest. I think it was a good decision of the company."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Do you think more companies will let people work from home?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Yes, I think so, because it is cheaper for the companies. But not every job can do it, for example in the factory the workers must be there."}],"criteria":[{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":9,"minBand":0,"key":"fluencyCoherence","levelBand":null,"name":"Fluency and Coherence","scope":"task","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":9,"minBand":0,"key":"lexicalResource","levelBand":null,"name":"Lexical Resource","scope":"task","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":9,"minBand":0,"key":"grammar","levelBand":null,"name":"Grammatical Range and Accuracy","scope":"task","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":9,"minBand":0,"key":"pronunciation","levelBand":null,"name":"Pronunciation","scope":"task","sound":true,"voiceOnly":true}],"task":{"brief":"The test's three parts in a shorter call","minutes":{"max":5,"min":5},"name":"Speaking mock","role":"examiner"},"title":"IELTS Speaking","exam":"ielts"}